title: "The Empirical Codex"
abstract: >-
  A conduct codex for autonomous AI coding agents, skinned as the pillars of
  empirical practice — the Bench, the Hypothesis, the Record, the Replication —
  each rule carrying an observable falsifier. Part of a small family of conduct
  harnesses.
